    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "11 Bolton Mews, Faithlegg, Co. Waterford X91 AP27\n\nHutchinson Auctioneers are delighted to bring 11 Bolton Mews to the market, a beautifully presented 2-bedroom property situated within the grounds of the prestigious Faithlegg House Hotel.\n\nPresented in **turn-key condition**, this attractive home offers comfortable and well-maintained accommodation in a peaceful and highly desirable setting. The surrounding grounds are professionally managed and maintained, providing a beautifully landscaped environment for residents to enjoy.\n\nThe accommodation comprises a spacious living area, kitchen/dining area, master bedroom with ensuite, second bedroom and family bathroom. The property is bright and welcoming throughout and is ready for immediate occupation.\n\nExternally, the property benefits from ample parking and enjoys the attractive surroundings of the Faithlegg House estate.\n\nThe location offers an excellent balance of peaceful country living and convenience, while being within easy reach of Waterford City and the surrounding areas. The setting within the grounds of Faithlegg House Hotel makes this a particularly attractive opportunity for those seeking a home in a unique and prestigious location.\n\nKey Features:\n\n* Beautifully presented 2-bedroom property\n* Master bedroom with ensuite\n* Family bathroom\n* Turn-key condition\n* Spacious living accommodation\n* Kitchen/dining area\n* Ample parking\n* Professionally managed and maintained grounds\n* Located within the grounds of Faithlegg House Hotel\n* Highly desirable residential setting\nConvenient access to Waterford City\n\nWhether you are looking for a permanent home, a peaceful retreat or an investment opportunity, 11 Bolton Mews offers an excellent opportunity to acquire a home in one of Waterford's most sought-after locations.\n\n\nProposed Management Fee for 2026 1,869.10\n\nViewing is highly recommended and is strictly by appointment with Hutchinson Auctioneers.\n\nTel: 051 876923\n\nEircode: X91 X299\n"
      },
